    "testNames": [
      "the exported concrete adapter satisfies the existing WalletAdapter interface",
      "one declared callback receives only the exact original 32-byte hash",
      "captured KeyPair methods survive replacement without calling composite preparation",
      "a synchronous SDK-style Address value is read through its data method",
      "a Buffer callback result becomes detached canonical signature DATA",
      "a Uint8Array callback result retains every original block field",
      "an inconsistent block hash is rejected before entering the borrowed owner",
      "already signed input cannot enter the signer",
      "changed public bytes are rejected even though they are outside the block hash",
      "a caller-selected different payer cannot substitute for the original block payer",
      "public bytes must derive the payer address even when both selections agree",
      "a mismatching current KeyPair address refuses before hash signing",
      "the owner address is rechecked after the initial address query",
      "pending signing holds a detached unsigned original across caller mutation",
      "a concurrent second call cannot poison the pending original attempt",
      "synchronous signer reentry is refused while the outer candidate completes",
      "a synchronous throw after signer entry preserves unknown outcome and original",
      "a rejected callback has a fixed public error without arbitrary reason data",
      "a malformed signature byte count is terminal without repairing the output",
      "an arbitrary thenable is refused without reading its then accessor",
      "a proxy native Promise is refused without invoking its traps",
      "a foreign Promise subclass cannot replace the supported result boundary",
      "a native Promise constructor getter is refused without invoking it",
      "signature proxies shared bytes and string substitutes are rejected",
      "configuration getters proxy owners and accessor methods are rejected without invocation",
      "block accessors and proxy blocks are rejected before the owner is called",
      "an Address toString accessor is refused before signing without invoking it",
      "invalid factory options and call arities do not grant another operation",
      "inspection preserves signed originals without clearing or exporting borrowed private state",
      "address callback reentry cannot start signing while address inspection is active",
      "a changed hash buffer during the callback leaves the signing outcome unknown",
      "the actual funding DATA codec retains the adapter output and exact independent checkpoint pins"
    ]
  },
